      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's very reassuring, but I'm looking at a raw data dump from the Chicago site that seems to contradict that. There's a cluster of patient reports from the last 24 hours mentioning severe dizziness and vertigo. \n\nIf your telemetry says \"zero adverse events,\" why aren't these specific reports showing up in your summary? Is there a lag in how these symptoms are being categorized, or am I looking at something that hasn't been integrated into your feed yet?",
